WEBVTT

00:00:08.209 --> 00:00:09.689
[panting]

00:00:09.863 --> 00:00:12.474
Hiccup, get me
down from here!

00:00:12.648 --> 00:00:14.520
You have to give me
a chance to explain.

00:00:14.694 --> 00:00:17.436
I am not listening to
anything you have to say!

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:20.743
Then I won't speak.
Just let me show you.

00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:23.529
Please, Astrid.

00:00:23.703 --> 00:00:26.488
- [grunts]
- [branches creak]

00:00:30.362 --> 00:00:32.407
[growls]

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:40.851
Now get me down.

00:00:41.025 --> 00:00:43.679
Toothless, down.
Gently.

00:00:45.377 --> 00:00:48.467
See? Nothing to be
afraid of.

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:51.252
Whaaah!

00:00:51.426 --> 00:00:52.775
Toothless!

00:00:54.255 --> 00:00:56.910
What is wrong with you?!
Bad dragon!

00:00:57.084 --> 00:01:00.392
[nervous laugh] He's not
usually like this.

00:01:00.566 --> 00:01:02.742
- Oh, no.
- [screaming]

00:01:06.615 --> 00:01:09.705
Toothless, what are you doing?
We need her to like us!

00:01:13.057 --> 00:01:15.494
- And now the spinning.
- [Astrid screaming]

00:01:15.668 --> 00:01:18.758
Thank you for nothing,
you useless reptile.

00:01:19.628 --> 00:01:22.544
OK, I am sorry! I'm sorry.

00:01:22.718 --> 00:01:24.764
Just get me off this thing.

00:03:11.044 --> 00:03:15.440
All right, I admit it.
This is pretty cool.

00:03:15.614 --> 00:03:18.356
It's amazing.

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:19.922
He's amazing.

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:24.710
So what now?

00:03:24.884 --> 00:03:27.582
Hiccup, your final exam
is tomorrow.

00:03:27.756 --> 00:03:29.758
You know
you'll have to kill...

00:03:29.932 --> 00:03:31.282
- [dragon growls, faint]
- ...kill a dragon.

00:03:31.456 --> 00:03:34.328
- Don't remind me.
- [both scream]

00:03:34.502 --> 00:03:35.895
[Hiccup] Toothless,
what's happening?

00:03:38.463 --> 00:03:40.943
- Whoa! What is it?
- [dragons roaring]

00:03:42.467 --> 00:03:43.903
Get down!

00:03:46.993 --> 00:03:50.605
[roaring]

00:04:01.007 --> 00:04:03.096
- What's going on?
- I don't know.

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:05.925
- Toothless, you got to
get us out of here, bud.
- [snarls]

00:04:08.623 --> 00:04:10.930
[Hiccup] It looks like
they're hauling in their kill.

00:04:11.104 --> 00:04:13.802
Uh... what does that
make us?

00:04:36.956 --> 00:04:39.872
[dragons snarling, roaring]

00:04:56.149 --> 00:04:58.934
What my dad wouldn't give
to find this.

